This folder contain the Receiver Side source code, in which the host PC is connected
This includes the source files and associated header files:
    - hid_device.c/h - implementing HID USB device functionality through TinyUSB library 
    - laser_tx_receiver.c/h - used for controlling sending through UART over laser link
    - laser_rx_receiver.c/h - used for controlling receiving through UART over laser link
    - packet_queue.c/h - used to implement queue data structures
    - msc_device.c/h - used to implement MSC Device functionality (not complete)
This folder also relies on both TinyUSB and STM32 HAL libraries, both of which are acknowledged and open source.
The created source files are covered under the MIT open source license. 